& KL uniform & 11.92$\pm$0.07 & 33.8$\pm$1.2 & 62.9$\pm$0.1 & 28.0$\pm$0.6 & 2.2$\pm$0.1 \\ % exp_id: bench_kl50_uniform, bench_kl50_uniform_s123, bench_kl50_uniform_s456
